<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-FRENCH LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FRENCH LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of French first division</p>
<p>matches on Thursday:</p>
<p>Bordeaux 1 (David Terrier 35 own goal) Metz 0. Halftime 1-0.</p>
<p>Attendance: 18,000.</p>
<p>Montpellier 0 Monaco 1 (John Collins 51). 0-0. 10,000.</p>
